                                "sense_id": "025f7c23-65f8-37f1-ad80-732f2f2be822",
                                "text": "To the Apoſtolical authority (ſaid Pope Adrian I.) by our Lord's command, and by the merits of Saint Peter, and by the decrees of the Holy Canons and of the Venerable Fathers, a right and ſpecial povver of convocating Synods hath many vviſe been committed; […]"
